1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"letter-cascade is-in","aria-label":"Thinkinghaus","children":[["$","b","T-0",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":0},"children":"T"}],["$","b","h-1",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":1},"children":"h"}],["$","b","i-2",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":2},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-3",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":3},"children":"n"}],["$","b","k-4",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":4},"children":"k"}],["$","b","i-5",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":5},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-6",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":6},"children":"n"}],["$","b","g-7",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":7},"children":"g"}],["$","b","h-8",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":8},"children":"h"}],["$","b","a-9",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":9},"children":"a"}],["$","b","u-10",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":10},"children":"u"}],["$","b","s-11",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":11},"children":"s"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","data-content-slug":"the-silent-type","data-content-title":"The silent type","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The silent type"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"July 1, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"2 minute read"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"author-edit-action","hidden":true,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://thinkinghaus-studio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-[Untitled Sans](https://klim.co.nz/fonts/untitled-sans/) began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer.",{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://klim.co.nz/fonts/untitled-sans/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Untitled Sans"]}]," began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer."]}],["$","p","1-Kris Sowersby removed some of the more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and then nearly threw it out. It was only after reading about [Super Normal](https://jaspermorrison.com/publications/essays/super-normal) that he found a way to understand the thing he’d been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist. I can identify with the arc: I try things, I change my mind, I forget why I started, I wander into something better.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Kris Sowersby removed some of the more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and then nearly threw it out. It was only after reading about ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://jaspermorrison.com/publications/essays/super-normal","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Super Normal"]}]," that he found a way to understand the thing he’d been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist. I can identify with the arc: I try things, I change my mind, I forget why I started, I wander into something better."]}],["$","p","2-He describes deliberately [removing traces](https://klim.co.nz/blog/untitled-sans-serif-design-information/) of his own recognizable style from the letters, scrubbing his fingerprints off the crime scene.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["He describes deliberately ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://klim.co.nz/blog/untitled-sans-serif-design-information/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["removing traces"]}]," of his own recognizable style from the letters, scrubbing his fingerprints off the crime scene."]}],["$","p","3-That sounds almost perverse to my designer brain. I'm encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist. But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me read.",{"className":"$undefined","children":"$Le"}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11"],"$L12","$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15"]}]]}]}]
16:I["0852856a0d0c",[],"Footer",1]
e:["That sounds almost perverse to my designer brain. I'm encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist. But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me read."]
f:["$","p","4-That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my [portfolio](https://maxpfennig.haus/) and for [Thinkinghaus](https://thinking.haus/). The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://maxpfennig.haus/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["portfolio"]}]," and for ",["$","a","3",{"href":"https://thinking.haus/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Thinkinghaus"]}],". The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put."]}]
10:["$","p","5-Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a mountain of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a mountain of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention."]}]
11:["$","p","6-I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it. Work that knows how to be quiet.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it. Work that knows how to be quiet."]}]
